      "message": "This usage of `NotRequired` is buggy. The happy-path return (when task data exists) omits `note` entirely. The MCP SDK validates the return value against the generated schema and apparently treats the absent `note` as `None`, which fails validation against `str`.\n\nThe fix is to change `note` from `NotRequired[str]` to `Optional[str]` and always include it in all return paths.\n\n(same bug fixed in a few of the later changes in this series)",
